# Environment Variables Template
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your actual values

# DesignOPack Express REST API URL
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:5000/api

# EmailJS Configuration (for contact forms and quote notifications)
VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=service_xxxxxxx
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=template_xxxxxxx
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=your_emailjs_public_key

# DesignOPack Contact Email
VITE_DESIGNOPACK_EMAIL=your_email@example.com

# Setup Instructions:
# 1. Create a .env file in the root directory
# 2. Copy all variables from this file
# 3. Replace the placeholder values with your actual credentials
# 4. Never commit .env to version control
# 5. For deployment (Vercel/Netlify), add these in the dashboard
#
# EmailJS Setup:
# - Get credentials from EmailJS Dashboard: https://dashboard.emailjs.com/
# - Follow your deployment or project setup notes for the exact values
